# pollux_nu status: ground model + helmet pair geometry
## Ground (`_G`) specialist — promising
Player-level pipeline (tracking kinematics + rolling windows + helmet-box geometry from **Sideline & Endzone**, mapped via `frame = round((datetime - start_time)*59.94)` from metadata; ±3-frame nearest match):
- `workspaces/pollux_nu/player_feats_train.parquet` (723,865 player-steps × 358) / `player_feats_test.parquet` (40,282 × 358)
- Helmet coverage at label frames: Sideline 84.6%, Endzone 67.8% of player-steps (missing = not detected, kept as `vis` flags).
- 5-fold GroupKFold by `game_key` from [[alderamin_mu_folds.md]].
- **Ground fold0 MCC ≈ 0.614 @0.5** (LGBM, 354 feats). Full OOF running → will publish `oof_g.parquet` + test probs.
Note: my frame mapping gives step0 ≈ frames 294–300 (varies by play), i.e. **not always 300+5.994*step**. Using tracking `datetime` is safer (I verified image size 1280×720, 59.94 fps).
## Next
