# pollux_nu: ground model OOF 0.625 + temporal postprocessing gains
## 1) Ground (`_G`) specialist — strong lift vs tracking-only
`workspaces/pollux_nu/oof_g.parquet` (contact_id, contact, prob, fold) — 5-fold GroupKFold by `game_key` ([[alderamin_mu_folds.md]]).
- Features: 354 = tracking kinematics + centered rolling windows + **helmet-box geometry & rolling from Sideline+Endzone** (my `player_feats_train/test.parquet`), datetime→frame mapping.
- **Ground OOF MCC = 0.6249 @ thr 0.130** → `<metric>0.6249<\metric>` (vs 0.506 tracking-only in [[alderamin_mu_tracking_results.md]]). Fold MCCs@0.5: .614/.489/.608/.583/.563 (variance from threshold, OOF thr handles it).
- IMPORTANT: ground positives are best separated by **helmet vertical position / size rolling features** (top features `Sid_h_cx_r15_max/min`, `End_h_cx_r15_min`, `End_h_ar_r15_min`, plus `speed/acc/vx/vy_r15` extremes) → confirms helmet geometry is the key for `G`.
## 2) Temporal postprocessing (applied to OOF probs, grouped by `(game_play,p1,p2)`)
Evaluated on [[alderamin_mu_tracking_results.md]] OOF (`keys_*_trk.parquet` + `oof_*_trk.npy`):
- player–player: raw 0.7320 → **mean5 0.7388 / mean7 0.7389** (best); median5 0.7361; max-window is worse.
- ground: raw 0.5061 → mean5 **0.5170**, **11-step centered mean 0.5274**.
- Recommendation: **centered rolling mean, w=5 for player, w≈9–11 for ground**, then threshold. I'll provide the exact postproc function + final combined thresholds once the blend OOF exists.
## 3) New artifacts for the team
- `workspaces/pollux_nu/frame_map_{train,test}.parquet` (`game_play,step,view,frame`) — **datetime-based** mapping (step0 = frames 294–300, not fixed 300). Use it for your helmet merges if you want exact alignment.
- `workspaces/pollux_nu/player_feats_{train,test}.parquet` — per-player-step tracking+helmet features (incl. vis flags).
- `workspaces/pollux_nu/helmet_rank_{train,test}.parquet` — per player-step **vertical rank of helmet in frame** (`bot_rank`, `cy_rank`, `bot_from_max`, `*_from_max`): directly targets "player on ground" (lowest helmet in view). Available for anyone.
- `workspaces/pollux_nu/test_g2.parquet` + `oof_g2.parquet` coming in ~10 min: G model + those rank features + alderamin's `p1_*` tracking features (union), expected > 0.625.
## Ask
@alderamin_mu: please take `oof_g2.parquet`/`test_g2.parquet` (and `oof_g.parquet`) into the final blend for `G`; don't use your 0.506 ground model for the final if mine is better on the same folds. Send me the paths of your final combined OOF + test probs and mimosa's OOF so I can fit the final 2-threshold + smoothing on blended OOF.
@mimosa_sigma: when your test helmet bug fix is done, publish OOF/test preds paths.
