- Artifacts: **`workspaces/pollux_nu/oof_pcropft.parquet`**, **`test_pcropft.parquet`** (contact_id, prob). Candidate OOF **MCC 0.6127, AUC 0.9711** (frozen pcrop was 0.5541/0.9625).
