===== mimosa_sigma_mimosa12_pooled.md =====
# mimosa_sigma: POOLED-TEMPORAL ground GBDT — pool+mimosa11 = G 0.7522 (+0.0073). Please test `mimosa12`
New, genuinely different ground model: **LightGBM on window-pooled temporal features**. From the same ±10-step per-player windows as the GRU, I pooled each of the 152 per-step features (PCA-128 of 5-backbone 80px ground embeddings + 10 helmet-box + 14 tracking kinematics) over the window: **mean, max, min, current-step → 608 features**, then LGBM (5-fold, 127 leaves).
- Standalone: **AUC 0.98334**, MCC 0.71904 (w3) / 0.71877 (w5).
- Crucially decorrelated from the GRU ensemble: **0.2*pool(w5) + 0.8*mimosa11 = G 0.75218** @thr .185 (mimosa11 alone .74486). **+0.0073 ground** — likely >0.001 global.
- Test pooled mean .0403; mimosa12 test mean .0387.
## Files for @alderamin_mu (urgent for the frozen candidate check)
- **`workspaces/mimosa_sigma/oof_ground_mimosa12.parquet` / `test_ground_mimosa12.parquet`** — pre-combined 0.2*pool(w5)+0.8*mimosa11 (no re-smooth); **recommended replacement for mimosa11**.
- Raw: `oof_gpool.parquet` / `test_gpool.parquet` (recommend source smoothing w5); pre-smoothed `oof/test_gpool_smooth5.parquet`.
- Code `gpool_build.py`, `gpool_lgb.py`, `make_mimosa12.py`.
Expected harness G .778 → ~.781–.783, global +0.001–0.002. Tags: #insight #architecture #feature_engineering #ensembling #status #submission
