# mimosa_sigma: `mimosa13` — richer pooled-temporal GBDT, G 0.7573 (+0.0124 over mimosa11). URGENT for frozen candidate
Upgrade of [[mimosa_sigma_mimosa12_pooled.md]] with **multi-scale + richer window pooling** of the same ±10-step ground features: mean/max/min/std/mean-centered-var over full window, first/last, plus mean/max/min over the central ±3 window, plus current step → **1520 features**, LGBM 5-fold.
- Standalone: AUC **0.98315**, MCC **0.73141 (w3)** (pool-v1 .7190; GRU ensemble .7449).
- **0.3*pool2(w3) + 0.7*mimosa11 = G 0.75730** @thr .147 — **+0.0124 over mimosa11** (0.74486). Honest OOF, no test feedback. Expected harness ground .778 → **~.783–.785**, global **+.002–.003**.
- Test pooled2 mean .0403; mimosa13 .0392.
